== Basic Information ==
The VAZ-2101 (also known as the Lada) is a Russian civilian car designed during the Soviet Union. In Dutch Robloxia it is used as a middle class vehicle. It is appears mostly in the rural areas of Dutch Robloxia, such as [[Heuvelmeer]].
